### dev
  * Change location string in details table to the format `contig:start-stop`
    (contig is included only when the `--filename-as-id` flag is used)
### v2.3
  * Fix wrong sequence ids with `--filename-as-id` (regression introduced in v2.1, see #2)
### v2.2
  * Update the bit vs bit-score relationship
### v2.1:
  * Improve runtime by reducing genome file loading; genome identifiers and lengths are now inferred directly from the BLAST database.
  * Add write-out of filtered BLAST results.
  * Fix a bug causing primers to be unintentionally reverse-complemented.
### v2.0:
  * Complete rewrite of AssayBLAST. Highlights include:
  * Automated interpretation of BLAST results to infer amplification type.
  * Automated optimization of BLAST E-value, improving both analytical sensitivity and computational performance.
  * Modularized into two command-line utilities to enable reuse of BLAST results.
### v1.0:
  * Initial release.
